      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm writing a paper for my religion class about how traditionalist theologians view recent changes in marriage and family definitions. can you help me by digging into the actual moral heart of their arguments? i don't just want a list of talking points, i want to understand the core moral reasoning they use to describe these shifts.",
